{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:05 2026-10-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:05 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:05 2026-10-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/a4e38e3e162dc5683173a8f377726486/2026-10/FotoJet_8.jpg\"/><p>跑馬地發生偷貓案。今日（15日）早上9時51分，集祥街6號一蔬果檔的店員報案，指店內飼養的一隻花貓不知所終，懷疑被人偷去。警員接報到場，翻查附近閉路電視片段，暫列作盜竊案展開調查。</p><p>據店員表示，失蹤的黑白色雄性花貓，名叫「蒜頭」，今年4歲，戴有米黃色頸圈連綠色圓扣，內有Airtag。「蒜頭」於昨日（14日）失蹤，Airtag記錄顯示牠於今日凌晨約1時曾在屯門新安街出現，故相信牠被人偷走。店員亦在網上發文尋貓，呼籲網友提供消息。</p><img alt=\"警員在蔬果店調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/702cd5f9ecbd5f70b546608d8f3c7b0b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_11_15_45.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3c44057b3ab925df80b6a88c167f314/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_11_15_44_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3925722847e61ee6ef400ff64d8f23ee/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_11_15_44.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70f6782aee33000844ae5ba11af6d8d7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_11_15_43_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是集祥街6號，「貓店長」失蹤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf66cab53ae24f8c8c79167024866011/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_11_15_43.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/887d0a967abaf84ed4eaf9217e1a69c6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_11_15_42.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/145d109614b513ee3e02cf9cac386f0e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_11_15_41.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.765811+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:05:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:18:21.761584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:06.479667+00:00","content_hash":"7c01d8892cc203d6e54d15250dd82b9bac615402683e795066c2353d6131adc4","evidence_status":"full"